  "sections": [
    {
      "block_id": "h1-1",
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 1,
      "content": "Coordination Migration Inventory",
      "disclosure": {
        "level": "standard",
        "initially_visible": true
      }
    },
    {
      "block_id": "p-2",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": "This inventory maps the coordination seam that started in `vibe.core.coordination` and now lives in `rig_relay.coordination.models`, `rig_relay.coordination.store`, and the Relay-native coordination tool execution helpers. `vibe.core.coordination` remains a compatibility adapter during alpha. The planning slice is inventory-first: no event-name changes, no schema changes, no payload behavior changes, and no circular imports from `rig_relay` back into `vibe`.",
      "disclosure": {
        "level": "standard"
      }
    },
    {
      "block_id": "h2-3",
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 2,
      "content": "Status",
      "disclosure": {
        "level": "standard",
        "initially_visible": true
      }
    },
    {
      "block_id": "p-4",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": "**Slice B complete (2026-05-13).** All three Relay-native modules are live:",
      "disclosure": {
        "level": "standard"
      }
    },
    {
      "block_id": "p-5",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": "- `rig_relay/coordination/_canonical_json.py` — stdlib-only JSON helper - `rig_relay/coordination/models.py` — full implementation, 10 Pydantic model classes - `rig_relay/coordination/store.py` — full implementation, `CoordinationStore` dataclass",
      "disclosure": {
        "level": "standard"
      }
    },
    {
      "block_id": "p-6",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": "`vibe.core.coordination._models`, `vibe.core.coordination._store`, and `vibe.core.coordination.__init__` are compatibility adapters. All 64 coordination tests pass through the Relay-native modules. No schema changes, no event-name changes, no circular imports.",
      "disclosure": {
        "level": "standard"
      }
    },
    {
      "block_id": "p-7",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": "**Next:** Coordination tool surface (`vibe.core.tools.builtins.coordination`→`rig_relay.coordination.tool`) — deferred by user.",
      "disclosure": {
        "level": "standard"
      }
    },
    {
      "block_id": "h2-8",
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 2,
      "content": "Current `vibe.core.coordination` Surface",
      "disclosure": {
        "level": "standard",
        "initially_visible": true
      }
    },
    {
      "block_id": "h3-9",
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 3,
      "content": "`vibe/core/coordination/_models.py`",
      "disclosure": {
        "level": "standard",
        "initially_visible": true
      }
    },
    {
      "block_id": "p-10",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": "- Legacy compatibility adapter re-exporting the Relay-native coordination models. - Existing imports still resolve for sessions, claims, reservations, conflicts, artifact references, state projections, event envelopes, payload builders, and hash helpers.",
      "disclosure": {
        "level": "standard"
      }
    },
    {
      "block_id": "h3-11",
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 3,
      "content": "`vibe/core/coordination/_store.py`",
      "disclosure": {
        "level": "standard",
        "initially_visible": true
      }
    },
    {
      "block_id": "p-12",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": "- Legacy compatibility adapter re-exporting the Relay-native file-backed store. - Session registration, heartbeat, task claim, path reservation, artifact publication, conflict reporting, release, handoff, stale-lease, and checkpoint-facing store flows continue to work unchanged. - Reads and writes coordination state under `.build/rig-relay/coordination/`.",
      "disclosure": {
        "level": "standard"
      }
    },
    {
      "block_id": "h3-13",
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 3,
      "content": "`vibe/core/coordination/__init__.py`",
      "disclosure": {
        "level": "standard",
        "initially_visible": true
      }
    },
    {
      "block_id": "p-14",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": "- Re-exports the public coordination models and store for current callers. - Acts as the compatibility import surface for legacy `vibe.*` code. - This module now points at Relay-owned coordination modules.",
      "disclosure": {
        "level": "standard"
      }
    },
