    },
    {
      "block_id": "p-25",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": "- `rig_relay/coordination/current_state.py` reads coordination sessions, leases, events, and derived storage summaries. - `rig_relay/coordination/cleanup_leases.py` scans lease files for stale and expired entries. - `rig_relay/evidence/storage_lifecycle.py` exposes the storage summary used by current_state and fleet preflight. - Tool builtins use the coordination store for claims, reservations, artifact publication, and conflict reporting.",
      "disclosure": {
        "level": "standard"
      }
    },
