    {
      "block_id": "p-42",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": "- Relay-native coordination action executor - helper surface for the built-in coordination tool",
      "disclosure": {
        "level": "standard"
      }
    },
    {
      "block_id": "h2-43",
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 2,
      "content": "Adapter Strategy",
      "disclosure": {
        "level": "standard",
        "initially_visible": true
      }
    },
    {
      "block_id": "p-44",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": "1. Move implementation into `rig_relay.coordination.*`. 2. Convert `vibe.core.coordination.*` into compatibility adapters/re-exports. 3. Update product-facing imports to Relay-native modules where safe. 4. Preserve legacy imports during alpha for runtime and tool callers. 5. Prevent circular imports from `rig_relay` back into `vibe`.",
      "disclosure": {
        "level": "standard"
      }
    },
    {
      "block_id": "h2-45",
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 2,
      "content": "Dataset-Backed Motivation",
      "disclosure": {
        "level": "standard",
        "initially_visible": true
      }
    },
    {
      "block_id": "p-46",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": "- Refinement item: `refine_406d97c0abd2` - Priority: `P0` - Tool name: `coordination` - Refinement kind: `add_coordination_hook` - Packet: `.build/rig-relay/refinement-packets/P0-coordination-add_coordination_hook/mission_packet.json`",
      "disclosure": {
        "level": "standard"
      }
    },
    {
      "block_id": "p-47",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": "Coordination migration should precede delegate/fleet and broader Intent API execution because the store is the shared boundary for claims, leases, conflicts, and current-state readiness.",
      "disclosure": {
        "level": "standard"
      }
    },
    {
      "block_id": "p-48",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": "The tool layer is now partially Relay-owned: `rig_relay.coordination.tool` owns the action executor while `vibe.core.tools.builtins.coordination` remains the registry-compatible adapter. Full tool registry migration is still deferred.",
      "disclosure": {
        "level": "standard"
      }
    },
    {
      "block_id": "h2-49",
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 2,
      "content": "Planning-Slice Rules",
      "disclosure": {
        "level": "standard",
        "initially_visible": true
      }
    },
    {
      "block_id": "p-50",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": "- No event-name changes in this slice. - No schema changes in this slice. - No payload behavior changes in this slice. - No circular imports from `rig_relay` to `vibe`.",
